        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST** \r\n\r\n*** LUXURY COTTAGE *** TWO BEDROOM / TWO BATHROOM *** SUNNY BACK GARDEN *** SUPERB LOCATION *** FULLY FURNISHED *** AVAILABLE NOW *** \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are very proud to present to the rental market this beautiful newly renovated two-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace cottage in the heart of Ballymore Eustace which offers a perfect blend of modern comfort, thoughtful design, and unique features. It's an ideal space for those seeking a tranquil yet stylish living environment. The property comprises of an entrance hallway, lounge, open plan kitchen dining area, two bedroom (ensuite), main bathroom, and a large sunny rear garden. \r\n\r\nBallymore Eustace is a wonderful place to live due to its peaceful and scenic surroundings, offering a perfect balance of rural charm and modern convenience. The village itself has a friendly community, with local amenities like shops, schools, and pubs within easy reach. Its location provides easy access to nearby towns such as Blessington & Naas and Dublin, making commuting convenient while still enjoying the tranquillity of countryside living. With beautiful landscapes, clean air, and a welcoming atmosphere, it's an ideal place for anyone looking to escape the hustle and bustle of city life. AVAILABLE NOW, and viewing highly advised. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n 2 bedroom 2 bathroom\r\n Newly renovated \r\n BER B3 \r\n Fully fitted kitchen\r\n Two generous bedrooms\r\n Double glazed windows\r\n Gas fired central heating \r\n Well maintained rear garden\r\n Fully furnished \r\n Ample on street parking\r\n Beautiful country village setting\r\n AVAILABLE NOW \r\n\r\n** RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE - FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE **"
      },
